    "summary": "PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nDynamic and results-driven Finance & Business Operations Leader with over 10 years of experience in managing end-to-end financial processes, project management, and cross-functional team leadership. Proven expertise in orchestrating large-scale transitions, optimizing operational workflows, and enhancing stakeholder satisfaction. Adept at coordinating complex projects, ensuring timely delivery, and maintaining high-quality standards in fast-paced, global environments.",
