    "experience": "PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\nLead – Finance & Business Operations Continuserve – Quatrro Business Solutions | July 2017 – March 2025 ● Spearheaded transition of financial operations for a North American logistics client, ensuring seamless onboarding and\ndelivery.\nDeveloped and implemented SOPs, KPIs, RCAs, and SLAs, reducing monthly operational costs by 50%. ● Scaled team from 4 to 120+ FTEs across finance operations; improved AHT from 8 mins to 5.4 mins. ● Created executive dashboards and MIS reports for budget tracking, variance analysis, and stakeholder reporting. ● Managed US/EU order processing lifecycle; implemented software improvements to enhance billing accuracy. Process Associate Altisource Business Solutions | June 2014 – June 2017 ● Managed mortgage process escalations and ensured compliance with insurance disbursement policies. ● Provided live support and training to new team members, including audit resolution and quality assurance.",
